B.Hn=new A.n2(B.Bd,"Let's Meet","A real-time video conferencing app with chat, screen sharing, and collaborative tools.","\ud83d\udcac Let's Meet \u2014 Real-Time Video Conferencing App\n\nA feature-rich virtual meeting application built as part of my 5th-semester academic project, designed to enhance online collaboration and productivity.\n\n\ud83d\ude80 Overview\nLet's Meet bridges the gap in current video conferencing platforms by offering integrated tools for professionals, educators, and businesses. From real-time video meetings to collaborative whiteboards and automatic attendance tracking, it provides a complete communication solution.\n\n\u2728 Key Features\n\u2705 Automatic Attendance Tracking \u2013 Smart presence detection without manual effort.\n\n\u270d\ufe0f Interactive Whiteboard \u2013 Real-time drawing & note-taking, exportable as PDF.\n\n\ud83d\udcac In-Meeting Chat \u2013 Live group discussions & Q&A.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f Cloud Storage Integration \u2013 Effortless file sharing via cloud services.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 High-Quality Video Conferencing \u2013 Powered by ZegoCloud API.\n\n\ud83d\udd10 Secure Authentication \u2013 Google Sign-In & Firebase Authentication.\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 Meeting Management \u2013 Schedule, join, and manage meetings with real-time logs & notifications.\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Tech Stack\nFlutter \u2013 Cross-platform UI (Android, iOS, Web, Desktop)\n\nFirebase \u2013 Authentication, Realtime Database, Cloud Storage, Cloud Functions\n\nZegoCloud API \u2013 Low-latency video & audio communication\n\nAdditional Libraries \u2013 Provider (state management), GetX (navigation & DI), Google Sign-In, Lottie (animations), Speech-to-Text, and more\n\n\ud83c\udfaf What I Did\nBuilt a real-time video conferencing app with chat, screen sharing, and collaboration tools.\n\nIntegrated third-party SDKs (ZegoCloud, Firebase) for video, authentication, and real-time data.\n\nImplemented deep linking, JWT authentication, and secure API integrations.\n\nFollowed clean coding & modular architecture, with manual testing for feature validation.",B.C6,"https://github.com/Dynamic2611/Let-s-Meet","assets/projects/letsmeet.png")
